                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "Henlo hooman, u gotz any joosy treatos in ur pocketz?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d26951c-bb0e-4a11-8689-53b280a3ac4a",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "[picture of a dog] Henlo! There is a global emergency! It’s called climate change!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "edf5800e-d22f-4543-889c-0ed1cdc92d8b",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "Henlo humans i brought over my friend moohorse"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f34264a-e2d3-4599-95af-9728db02edd6",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "Henlo Honi, Just wanted to say I really enjoyed the Week 2 edition of Honi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b2bf862-fb91-44e8-8404-559b88462a04",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "Henlo. My name is Doug, I’m 4 years old, and I’m a hooman. Yes, I am very sure of this."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "618e8291-b493-46f7-af04-5982c4eee72f",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "Henlo, frens: MCO brings back ‘Paw Pilots’ therapy dogs after too-long pandemic hiatus"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86a559e2-0f07-47ed-929e-72d705cfdb91",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "“HENLO WORLD WUT IZ MET GALA I AM DOG.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2870348-bbf7-4202-9729-c289558a2d27",
                                                "sense_id": "6f243de5-e603-3a2e-9e25-a205e9485588",
                                                "text": "You can visit her on Instagram @[…] and say henlo to her pet bunny Peepers @[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
